{"id":"22d60845d1deaad2","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/616_Stalnaker_条件逻辑.md","title":"616 Stalnaker 条件逻辑","display":"616_Stalnaker_条件逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{st}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{st}\\)</span>，显示</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A&gt;B=\\operatorname{st}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A&gt;B=\\operatorname{st}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{st}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{st}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span> 是满足下列形成子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&gt;B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(A&gt;B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{616}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{616}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(A&gt;B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(A&gt;B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{616}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{616}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{616}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{616}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{616}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{616}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{616}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A&gt;B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)&gt;\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A&gt;B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)&gt;\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{616}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{616}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{616}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{616}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{616}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{616}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{616}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{616}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{616}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{616}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,616}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,616}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{616}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{616}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{616}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{616}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{616}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{616}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Stalnaker 条件公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{StK}^{616}\n=\n\\{(A&gt;(B\\to C))\\to((A&gt;B)\\to(A&gt;C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{StK}^{616}\n=\n\\{(A&gt;(B\\to C))\\to((A&gt;B)\\to(A&gt;C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{StID}^{616}\n=\n\\{A&gt;A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{StID}^{616}\n=\n\\{A&gt;A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCEM}^{616}\n=\n\\{(A&gt;B)\\lor(A&gt;\\neg B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCEM}^{616}\n=\n\\{(A&gt;B)\\lor(A&gt;\\neg B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCenter}^{616}\n=\n\\{(A&gt;B)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCenter}^{616}\n=\n\\{(A&gt;B)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCSO}^{616}\n=\n\\{((A&gt;B)\\land(B&gt;A))\\to((A&gt;C)\\leftrightarrow(B&gt;C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCSO}^{616}\n=\n\\{((A&gt;B)\\land(B&gt;A))\\to((A&gt;C)\\leftrightarrow(B&gt;C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{616}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{616}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StK}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StID}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCEM}^{616}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCenter}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCSO}^{616}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{616}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{616}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StK}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StID}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCEM}^{616}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCenter}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCSO}^{616}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{616}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{616}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{616}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A&gt;B)\\to(A&gt;C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{616}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A&gt;B)\\to(A&gt;C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{616}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A&gt;C)\\leftrightarrow(B&gt;C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{616}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A&gt;C)\\leftrightarrow(B&gt;C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{616}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{616}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{616}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{616}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{616}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{616}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{616}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span>。每行至少满足下列 5 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{616}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{616}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\to C\">\\(A_j=B\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A&gt;B)\\to(A&gt;C)\">\\(A_i=(A&gt;B)\\to(A&gt;C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A&gt;C)\\leftrightarrow(B&gt;C)\">\\(A_i=(A&gt;C)\\leftrightarrow(B&gt;C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{616}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{616}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{616}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{616}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{616}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{616}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{616}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{616}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{616}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{616}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{616}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{616}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\\)</span>。由证明前缀闭包，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{616}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{616}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{616}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{616}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{616}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{616}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{616}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{616}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{616}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{616}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{616}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{616}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{616}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{616}(A&gt;B)\\to(A&gt;C)}\\;(RCK),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{616}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{616}(A&gt;C)\\leftrightarrow(B&gt;C)}\\;(RCEA).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{616}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{616}(A&gt;B)\\to(A&gt;C)}\\;(RCK),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{616}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{616}(A&gt;C)\\leftrightarrow(B&gt;C)}\\;(RCEA).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-最近世界语义\">8. 最近世界语义</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"616\">\\(616\\)</span>-Stalnaker 模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{StalMod}_{616}\">\\(\\mathsf{StalMod}_{616}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,s),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,s),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to W\\cup\\{\\bot_s\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to W\\cup\\{\\bot_s\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(w,X)=\\bot_s\">\\(s(w,X)=\\bot_s\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\varnothing\">\\(X=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(w,X)\\in X\">\\(s(w,X)\\in X\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(X\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w\\in X\\Rightarrow s(w,X)=w,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w\\in X\\Rightarrow s(w,X)=w,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s(w,X)\\in Y\\land s(w,Y)\\in X\\Rightarrow s(w,X)=s(w,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s(w,X)\\in Y\\land s(w,Y)\\in X\\Rightarrow s(w,X)=s(w,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>（等式仅在两个选择值均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 时使用）。前一约束对应中心性，后一约束对应 CSO。公式真值集</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\to B⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\to B⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A&gt;B⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:s(w,⟦ A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M})=\\bot_s\n\\text{ 或 }s(w,⟦ A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M})\\in⟦ B⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A&gt;B⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:s(w,⟦ A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M})=\\bot_s\n\\text{ 或 }s(w,⟦ A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M})\\in⟦ B⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足与语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{616}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{616}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{616}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{616}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,s)\\in\\mathsf{StalMod}_{616}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{616}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{616}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{616}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,s)\\in\\mathsf{StalMod}_{616}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{616}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{616}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>Stalnaker 条件逻辑在本文件中由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;\">\\(&gt;\\)</span> 构造子、条件排中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCEM}^{616}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCEM}^{616}\\)</span>、中心性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCenter}^{616}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{StCenter}^{616}\\)</span> 与 CSO 共同固定。它不是单独的 Lewis <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、VC 或 VW。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-结构说明\">10. 结构说明</h1>\n<p>所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;\">\\(&gt;\\)</span> 公式的句法替换与规则行为均逐构造定义；这些句法定义不依赖第 8 节的最近世界语义。第 8 节和最终系统展示仍包含该语义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Stal}_{616}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\operatorname{FV}_{616},\\operatorname{BV}_{616},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{616},\\operatorname{Sub}_{616},\\equiv_{\\alpha,616},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{616},\\mathsf{Rule}_{616},\\mathsf{Proof}_{616},\\operatorname{last}_{616},\n\\vdash_{616},\\mathsf{Thm}_{616},\\mathsf{Cert}_{616},\n\\mathsf{StalMod}_{616},⟦-⟧_{616},\\Vdash_{616},\\models_{616}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Stal}_{616}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\operatorname{FV}_{616},\\operatorname{BV}_{616},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{616},\\operatorname{Sub}_{616},\\equiv_{\\alpha,616},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{616},\\mathsf{Rule}_{616},\\mathsf{Proof}_{616},\\operatorname{last}_{616},\n\\vdash_{616},\\mathsf{Thm}_{616},\\mathsf{Cert}_{616},\n\\mathsf{StalMod}_{616},⟦-⟧_{616},\\Vdash_{616},\\models_{616}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 Stalnaker 条件句法、公理、规则、证明关系、最近世界选择语义与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-最近世界语义","text":"8. 最近世界语义","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-结构说明","text":"10. 结构说明","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{st}","display":false},{"tex":"A>B=\\operatorname{st}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{st}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{616}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\